# Skills routing

When the task matches a row, **read** `.agents/skills/<skill>/SKILL.md` (or `.cursor/skills/aif-<name>/SKILL.md`) **before** coding. User does not need to name the skill.

| Task | Skills |
|------|--------|
| Any work in this repo | `anrotrip` |
| `.astro`, routing, content collections | `astro`, `tailwind-4-docs` |
| `global.css`, Tailwind utilities | `tailwind-4-docs` |
| UI components, layout polish | `web-design-guidelines` |
| A11y, aria, keyboard | `accessibility` |
| LCP, CLS, INP, perf | `core-web-vitals` |
| Security, CSP, XSS review | `best-practices`; deep audit → `aif-security-checklist` |
| Docker, compose, GHCR | `docker-patterns` |
| `.github/workflows`, CI | `github-actions-templates` |
| `e2e/`, Playwright | `playwright-best-practices` |
| `site.webmanifest`, SW, PWA | `pwa-development` |
| SEO audit, meta, OG | `seo-audit`, `schema` |
| Blog posts, journal copy | `content-strategy`, `copywriting` |
| Landing CTAs, forms conversion | `cro` |
| Analytics events, tracking plan | `analytics` |
| Plan feature / tasks | `aif-plan` |
| Implement from plan | `aif-implement` |
| Commit message | `aif-commit` |
| Pre-deploy security | `aif-security-checklist` |
| QA / test plan | `aif-qa` |

Full list + install: `.doc/meta/skills-primary-shortlists.md` · `pnpm skills:install`.
